cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OptiQuake Local"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Experimental open-source platform for local optical vibration monitoring
  using compatible webcams. It reports vibration events and supports Python
  plugins and AI-agent integrations. It is not a certified earthquake detector
  or a guaranteed early-warning system.
keywords:
  - optical vibration monitoring
  - webcam sensing
  - experimental vibration detection
  - local sensing
  - Python plugins
  - open-source software
authors:
